.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH start-tunnel-auth-key-add 1  "add "
.SH NAME
start\-tunnel\-auth\-key\-add \- Add a new authorized key
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-tunnel auth key add\fR [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-user\-agent\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIKEY\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a new authorized key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Name shown for the key in the key list
.TP
\fB\-\-user\-agent\fR \fI<USER_AGENT>\fR
User agent shown for the key in the key list
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIKEY\fR>
Device key to enroll, in DER64 or PEM form
